Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.25,0:00:04.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jagirinawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's definitely the Jagirinawa, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.97,0:00:11.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Snake Cutter, Snake Rope, or Snake Cutter Rope
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.85,0:00:15.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's occasionally called the Serpent, also.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.64,0:00:17.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Serpent? So it's a snake?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.64,0:00:21.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oshino, what kind of aberration is the Jagirinawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.23,0:00:24.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's an aberration that moves according to one's ill will.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.19,0:00:27.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, not just ill will alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.15,0:00:30.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}but when someone calls the Jagirinawa, I can't really think of it as anything but ill will.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.03,0:00:33.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah. I heard about that from Sengoku, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.66,0:00:37.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The one who put the curse on her was her classmate's friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.29,0:00:39.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess it's a pretty well-known curse among middle schoolers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.67,0:00:41.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.25,0:00:45.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Jagirinawa isn't really something that can be controlled by amateurs...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.30,0:00:50.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}But anyway, why did her classmate's friend want to curse the little lady in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.05,0:00:52.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard it was about romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.47,0:00:57.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The boy the girl liked confessed to Sengoku,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:01:00.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but Sengoku rejected him, unaware of the situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.35,0:01:02.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and became resented.\NOr something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.15,0:01:06.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After Sengoku found out that she was cursed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:08.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she started reading books about snake curses,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.28,0:01:11.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,looking into the way to lift the curse, and performed the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.16,0:01:16.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Killing a snake to release a snake curse seems pretty sketchy to me, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.66,0:01:20.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's more, her situation's gotten worse since she started killing snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.33,0:01:23.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. Araragi-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.67,0:01:27.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,chopping up snakes to counter the Jagirinawa isn't wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.59,0:01:28.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In fact, it's exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.96,0:01:30.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.72,0:01:32.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She messed up the procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.76,0:01:37.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lifting a curse is harder than casting one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.26,0:01:40.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With an amateur level of knowledge, the situation is bound to get worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.56,0:01:45.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plus, she was really unlucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.18,0:03:41.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.55,0:03:43.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Koyomi-oniichan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.47,0:03:44.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How'd it go, Araragi-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.18,0:03:46.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.27,0:03:49.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can release Sengoku from her curse with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.65,0:03:51.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.56,0:03:53.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and we can erase the scale marks, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.69,0:03:58.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if we want to remove the curse, we have to do it at that shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.86,0:04:03.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just to be safe, we should do it tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.58,0:04:06.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sengoku, is it okay if you go home late tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.29,0:04:07.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.75,0:04:11.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll tell my mom that I'm staying at a friend's house tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:15.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll need several other things for the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:16.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:19.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, you go call your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.09,0:04:20.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:27.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, there might be a lot of stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.89,0:04:27.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so could you come with me, Kanbaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.35,0:04:29.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.65,0:04:34.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sengoku is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.15,0:04:39.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we don't act tonight, it'll threaten her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.65,0:04:40.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:48.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Jagirinawa has taken the form of an invisible snake, and it's constantly constricting her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.41,0:04:51.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The scale marks are the proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.50,0:04:56.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}According to Oshino, if the scales reach her face, she can't be saved anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.51,0:05:03.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it's constricting her, then shouldn't Sengoku-chan be in pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.80,0:05:06.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oshino said it should hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.02,0:05:09.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's probably just holding it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.31,0:05:14.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That classmate didn't have to go so far just because
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.94,0:05:16.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sengoku-chan rejected the boy she liked...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:17.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:19.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The curse itself isn't anything special.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.61,0:05:25.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Actually, the curse shouldn't even have activated, since it was cast by an amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.58,0:05:29.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then... why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.20,0:05:31.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems she made a mistake while trying to break the curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.12,0:05:36.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was also pretty unlucky, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.67,0:05:44.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}The shrine where the little lady slaughtered the snakes used to be an insignificant place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.26,0:05:47.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was before Shinobu-chan came...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.14,0:05:50.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,along with the noble blood of the legendary vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.27,0:05:52.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The king of aberrations: the vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.52,0:05:57.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that, all sorts of bad things started gathering at that shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.77,0:06:00.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's also why you weren't feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.78,0:06:01.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.24,0:06:06.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Yeah, the Jagirinawa activated because she slaughtered the snakes in that shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.49,0:06:10.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If she hadn't done it there, everything would've been fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:16.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's really like Sengoku-chan hurt herself with her own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.67,0:06:18.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then Araragi-senpai,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.05,0:06:23.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,wouldn't it be dangerous to do the ceremony in that shrine again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.51,0:06:29.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. If we follow the procedure correctly, it'll bring out the Jagirinawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:30.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So it'll actually benefit us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.90,0:06:44.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sengoku...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.07,0:06:48.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it, Koyomi-oniichan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.87,0:06:53.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those scale marks... They actually hurt, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.91,0:06:56.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.88,0:07:01.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-About that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.38,0:07:03.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't get mad, Koyomi-oniichan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.26,0:07:06.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. I'm not mad or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.30,0:07:08.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was just wondering if you're okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.26,0:07:14.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It does feel like I'm being squeezed, but it's not unbearable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:19.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thinking that you have to hold it in is weird in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.15,0:07:24.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it hurts, it's okay to say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.82,0:07:26.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's right, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.66,0:07:33.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Just getting tied up is no big deal, but staying tied up for a while is surprisingly hard on your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.83,0:07:36.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have absolutely no clue why you'd say being tied up isn't a big deal,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.75,0:07:41.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or why you completely ignored her mental pain, Kanbaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.60,0:07:52.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.13,0:08:32.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, Sengoku...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.43,0:08:32.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.47,0:08:38.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}You said there was a boy who confessed to you... Why did you turn him down?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:40.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.44,0:08:47.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there's already someone else I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.20,0:08:55.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koyomi-oniichan, how much do you remember from back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.41,0:08:58.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To be honest... not very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.33,0:09:00.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My memory's not all too great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.67,0:09:03.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.00,0:09:07.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On the other hand, you really remembered me well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.38,0:09:11.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's because I didn't really get along with others very much...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.47,0:09:21.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Back then, the only one I could play with after school was Rara-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.94,0:09:24.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rara-chan? You mean Tsukihi-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.02,0:09:28.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rara-chan and I ended up going to different middle schools later,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.48,0:09:33.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}but those times of playing with you and Rara-chan are my most precious memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.58,0:09:36.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:40.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plus, I'm an only child.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.87,0:09:44.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was really jealous that she had an older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.56,0:09:59.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru, are you feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.72,0:10:02.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.77,0:10:04.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm prepared this time, so it's not as bad as I thought it'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.65,0:10:06.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.90,0:10:13.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru, I did tell you to bring clothes that would make it easy to see if
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.90,0:10:16.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the scale marks were gone or not, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.12,0:10:20.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why the hell would you be carrying around a school swimsuit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:24.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was just trying to match it up with your preferences...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.87,0:10:25.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To hell with your matching!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.96,0:10:27.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I notice you don't deny this is your preference.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.34,0:10:36.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sit in the middle, on the sheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.64,0:10:39.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold the charm tightly,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.81,0:10:43.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,close your eyes, breathe steadily, and then you can start praying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.19,0:10:47.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Praying? To what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:48.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.94,0:10:50.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe, in this situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.73,0:10:54.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.28,0:10:56.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.49,0:11:01.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koyomi-oniichan, make sure you watch, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.54,0:11:03.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.91,0:11:07.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please watch over me carefully, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.63,0:11:09.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Just leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.14,0:11:24.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please watch me, Koyomi-oniichan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.99,0:11:37.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.99,0:11:42.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.66,0:11:47.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're in sixth grade, but you're not scary at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.92,0:11:50.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't pick on me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:51.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Moreover...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.30,0:11:55.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you're really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.46,0:11:58.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You even fixed my bike for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.85,0:12:03.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:06.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,not...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.85,0:12:11.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rara-chan's so lucky, having such a nice brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.65,0:12:14.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.61,0:12:26.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it okay if I call you... Koyomi-oniichan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.58,0:12:28.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.40,0:12:57.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like it's finally breaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.28,0:12:59.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but Araragi-senpai,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.57,0:13:02.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,now you're in debt to Oshino-san again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.49,0:13:08.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With something this strong, it's going to be a pretty high price, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.54,0:13:12.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nah. This time, there's no debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.67,0:13:18.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Kanbaru, remember when I told you that this was turning into a place where evil things gather?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.80,0:13:19.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.88,0:13:25.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Such places are dangerous, because they could turn into a spiritual world war at the drop of a hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.06,0:13:31.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By putting that charm on the shrine, we nipped that in the bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.48,0:13:34.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was that dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.77,0:13:36.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.53,0:13:39.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He said that charm was pocket change in comparison.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.08,0:13:58.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This removal ceremony sure takes a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.34,0:14:01.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I agree, but all we can do is wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.09,0:14:05.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, Araragi-senpai, Sengoku-chan is already really worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.93,0:14:10.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't we just pull the Jagirinawa off in one go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.10,0:14:15.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oshino said that I should be able to touch it and even pull it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.11,0:14:19.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.11,0:14:24.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you do, the Jagirinawa will undoubtedly attack you instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.70,0:14:25.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plus...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.91,0:14:29.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if I'm able to get away from it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.12,0:14:34.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it'll just go back to the classmate who placed the curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.21,0:14:36.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So basically, "What goes around comes around."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.83,0:14:37.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.09,0:14:42.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"What goes around comes around."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.55,0:14:48.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, I'm repeating myself, but remember that saying and really think about what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.72,0:14:49.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.93,0:14:52.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't really know what you're thinking about,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.77,0:14:54.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but someday, I'm going to leave town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.44,0:15:01.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When that happens, I won't be able to give you advice anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.57,0:15:06.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aberrations aren't the type to get involved with humans on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.66,0:15:11.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}But you're the type of person that jumps in, even when you should leave something alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.62,0:15:12.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if it comes to my attention...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:15.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.75,0:15:16.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't just act like I didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.04,0:15:22.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would it have been better if you just forgot everything like your class rep?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.88,0:15:24.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forgetting everything is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.92,0:15:26.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess that was a bit mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.34,0:15:28.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.51,0:15:34.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}We're pretty good friends now, so I'm not just going to disappear without saying goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.81,0:15:36.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am an adult, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:38.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know the right thing to do, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.15,0:15:44.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}But since you're already thinking about your future, I think it'd be good to think about that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.03,0:15:49.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Basically, what you're saying is that my desire to help people is immature, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:53.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Oshino, I can't be like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.62,0:15:57.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm one-tenth vampire -- an aberration.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.87,0:16:00.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't become someone who exterminates them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:06.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Araragi-kun, if you abandon Shinobu-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.67,0:16:08.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you can turn back to a normal human being again whenever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.97,0:16:11.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.05,0:16:14.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.81,0:16:20.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.23,0:16:22.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I don't know. Suddenly...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.28,0:16:31.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did we mess up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.28,0:16:34.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We messed up, didn't we, Araragi-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.58,0:16:36.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, that can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.17,0:16:45.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.63,0:16:51.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru, I misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.51,0:16:52.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.85,0:16:58.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we were just able to see the Jagirinawa, it would've been completely obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.31,0:17:00.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.89,0:17:03.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There wasn't just one Jagirinawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.94,0:17:05.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There were two!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.32,0:17:07.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.79,0:17:23.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay back, Kanbaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.71,0:17:30.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}It wasn't just the girl who used to be her friend that held a grudge against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.18,0:17:33.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.39,0:17:38.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The boy she rejected held a grudge, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.85,0:17:43.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if I can't see it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.32,0:17:47.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should be able to touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.94,0:19:09.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This might just work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.19,0:19:18.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Even if you can't see the Jagirinawa, they still leave traces when they move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.07,0:19:20.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is listen for moving dirt and watch for parting grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.54,0:19:25.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can estimate its location.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.67,0:19:35.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.07,0:19:54.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-senpai, forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.78,0:20:02.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.49,0:20:04.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Calm down! Don't get excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.91,0:20:07.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you get excited, the poison will spread, Araragi-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.92,0:20:11.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Snakes are fierce animals, but they're cowards!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.59,0:20:14.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you leave it alone, it'll just go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:19.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Kanbaru, if I do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.22,0:20:22.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that snake will just go back to that boy Sengoku turned down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.10,0:20:24.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-senpai, I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.18,0:20:28.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't forget who you're trying to save...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.17,0:20:53.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't make it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.75,0:20:57.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if I want to follow it, chasing invisible snakes is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.21,0:20:57.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,impossible for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.01,0:21:00.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.26,0:21:04.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.97,0:21:08.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,for putting you in such a tough situation...\NSorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.98,0:21:11.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't apologize. It was necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.65,0:21:14.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.36,0:21:18.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Kanbaru...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.11,0:21:23.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:37.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The snakes are gone.\NThey've gone back to those who called them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.67,0:21:41.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Along with the curses they carried.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.18,0:21:45.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koyomi-oniichan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.39,0:21:48.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru made the right decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.02,0:21:52.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}For a half-assed aberration like me, standing up to a real aberration is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.81,0:21:56.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just couldn't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.82,0:22:01.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koyomi-oniichan, thanks for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.99,0:22:04.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't say that, Sengoku. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.70,0:22:08.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.83,0:22:13.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't deserve your gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.58,0:22:21.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did something unthinkable, and tried to save even the guy who cursed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.10,0:23:57.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Karen!\NI'm Tsukihi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.56,0:24:00.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Its about time to expose just who we are and introduce ourselves properly!{she actually says formal introduction}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.81,0:24:02.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's too late! It's past too late! It's been far too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.15,0:24:06.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder how many of them are wondering just who is who!{This is the joke}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.57,0:24:07.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Probably everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.49,0:24:10.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am Araragi Karen! Araragi Koyomi's little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.16,0:24:12.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am Araragi Tsukihi! Araragi Koyomi's little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.70,0:24:14.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A third year student in middle school!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.24,0:24:15.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A second year student in middle school!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.95,0:24:17.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Together we're the Fire sisters!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.92,0:24:20.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just kidding! I was Tsukihi!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.96,0:24:22.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just kidding! I was Karen!{yes, past tense... and thug just happens to be same}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.63,0:24:25.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We switched just in case!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.84,0:24:26.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if you fell for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.92,0:24:28.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You fell for it didn't you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.26,0:24:29.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next time! Tsubasa Cat Part 1!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.05,0:24:31.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, which one am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.34,0:24:32.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Preview Quiz!
